
@CounterpartyRegistry_HostAddress = https://localhost:7273

### Получить всех контрагентов
GET {{CounterpartyRegistry_HostAddress}}/api/counterparties
Accept: application/json

###

### Получить контрагента по ID
GET {{CounterpartyRegistry_HostAddress}}/api/counterparties/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Добавить нового контрагента
POST {{CounterpartyRegistry_HostAddress}}/api/counterparties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ООО Новый Контрагент",
  "inn": "7701111111",
  "kpp": "770101001",
  "ogrn": "1234567890125",
  "legalAddress": "г. Москва, ул. Тестовая, д. 1",
  "phone": "+7 900 111-11-11",
  "email": "test@example.ru",
  "contactPerson": "Иванов Иван",
  "status": "Активен"
}
### Изменить контрагента
PUT {{CounterpartyRegistry_HostAddress}}/api/counterparties/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ООО Новый Контрагент Плюс",
  "inn": "7701111111",
  "kpp": "770101001",
  "ogrn": "1234567890125",
  "legalAddress": "г. Москва, ул. Новая, д. 5",
  "phone": "+7 900 222-22-22",
  "email": "new@example.ru",
  "contactPerson": "Петров Петр",
  "status": "Активен"
}
### удалить контрагента
DELETE {{CounterpartyRegistry_HostAddress}}/api/counterparties/3
Accept: application/json
